WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The prototype needs a small database and a checklist before the pilot.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
We agreed to use SQLite for the prototype.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.000
Priya will send the checklist by Friday.

00:19.000 --> 00:26.000
We need to review the migration. No owner or date was set.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
Postgres was suggested for a later release, but no decision was made about it.
